@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Index a document (2 headings → at least 2 chunks)
POST {{host}}/documents
X-Tenant-Id: acme
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": "refund-policy",
  "title": "Refund policy",
  "url": "https://intranet/policies/refunds",
  "allowedGroups": ["all-staff"],
  "text": "# Refunds\nCustomers can return shoes within 30 days.\n# Electronics\nElectronics can be returned within 15 days, unopened."
}

### 2. Same request again → "unchanged" (same hash, no embedding call)

### 3. Permissions changed → plain UPDATE, no re-embedding
PUT {{host}}/documents/refund-policy/permissions
X-Tenant-Id: acme
Content-Type: application/json

{ "allowedGroups": ["hr"] }

### 4. Source document deleted → document + chunks gone (cascade)
DELETE {{host}}/documents/refund-policy
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### Model upgrade: set Embeddings:DualWrite = true (new uploads get v1 + v2, backfill fills old rows),
### wait for "v2 backfill done" in the log, then set Embeddings:QueryVersion = "v2". Roll back = set it to "v1".
